      reduced administrative burden. The IRB of the NHO Okayama Medical Center had 
      approved these procedures and the conduct of this study. This was a retrospective 
      study and informed consent from patients was not required. Informed consent was 
      waived for the study and consent to participate was also waived by the ethics 
