AB  - Malignant central airway obstruction (MCAO) is obstruction of the trachea or 
      mainstem bronchi due to a cancerous mass. This article describes the 
      presentation, management considerations, and outcomes of patients with MCAO, with 
      a focus on therapeutic bronchoscopy.
