TI  - Tracheobronchial adenoid cystic carcinoma in pregnancy.
LID - e261795 [pii]
LID - 10.1136/bcr-2024-261795 [doi]
AB  - A case of tracheobronchial adenoid cystic carcinoma diagnosed around the time of 
      conception and its progression during pregnancy is presented. The evidence that 
      pregnancy may be associated with the progression of adenoid cystic cancer is 
      discussed. It is important to consider tracheal disease before making a diagnosis 
      of adult-onset asthma.
